# FROZEN IRREPLACEABLE EVIDENCE — NEVER NORMALIZE.
#
# The producing vintage (claude-opus-4-8[1m], h1-certified-reader-v3.2) is dead;
# these bytes cannot be regenerated. On the first commit git's CRLF->LF
# normalization silently rewrote 250 of 275 blobs, so the STORED evidence no
# longer matched MANIFEST.sha256 (and no longer matched what the dead vintage
# actually produced). `-text` disables all EOL conversion: bytes are stored and
# checked out verbatim, and the manifest stays verifiable from a fresh clone.
* -text
